<title>HUNGARY: PICK GROUP Q1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>PICK GROUP Q1 '97 AFTER-TAX PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three-month period ending March</p>
<p>31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Jan-March 1997   Jan-March 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	  578.5     vs    503.9</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	    577.6     vs    411.1</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	  566.4     vs    406.4</p>
<p>    Group net sales		 6,682.5     vs  5,940.2</p>
<p>	Net domestic sales	  3,994.5     vs  3,579.9</p>
<p>	Net export sales	    2,688.2     vs  2,360.3</p>
<p>    Group other revenue		79.0     vs     69.2</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales	5,196.9     vs   4,535.0</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales	885.1     vs     869.5</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	     129.4     vs     123.9</p>
<p>    Net financial income	     0.6 loss vs     87.2 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue		29.5     vs	 4.5</p>
<p>     Financial expenditures	 30.1     vs	91.6</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	 0.3 loss vs	5.6 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue	   0.0     vs	 0.2</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expenditures    0.3     vs	 5.8</p>
<p>    Taxation			    15.7     vs	 8.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Pick Szeged Rt is a meat processor.</p>
<p>The figures are consolidated, they are not audited and were</p>
<p>calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
